{"seq":3,"slug":"lr-scheduling","title":"学习率调度与预热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/optimizers/lr-scheduling","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"学习率调度与预热\">学习率调度与预热</h1><p><a href=\"adaptive-adam\">优化器</a>决定「往哪个方向、按什么比例走」，而学习率决定「整体走多快」。前面已经看到，<a href=\"../foundations/gradient-descent-variants\">最优学习率会随训练阶段变化</a>：开始时太大会冲垮尚未稳定的初始化，中段需要足够大以充分探索，末段又要足够小以稳定收敛。学习率调度就是把学习率写成训练步数的函数，让它在不同阶段取不同值。它是工程上回报率最高、最值得反复打磨的旋钮之一——同样的模型，调度换一下，最终质量可能差出一大截。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预热加衰减的两段式\">核心概念：预热加衰减的两段式</h2><p>现代大模型训练的学习率几乎都遵循「预热 + 衰减」的两段式形状。预热（warmup）指训练初期让学习率从接近零线性爬升到峰值，通常持续几百到几千步；衰减（decay）指爬到峰值后按某种曲线逐步降到很小。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[训练开始 lr 接近 0] --&gt; B[预热阶段&lt;br/&gt;线性爬升到峰值 lr_max]&#10;  B --&gt; C[峰值附近&lt;br/&gt;充分探索损失地形]&#10;  C --&gt; D{衰减策略}&#10;  D --&gt;|余弦| E[平滑降到接近 0]&#10;  D --&gt;|线性| F[匀速降到接近 0]&#10;  D --&gt;|WSD| G[先恒定 再快速退火]&#10;  E --&gt; H[末段稳定收敛]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[训练开始 lr 接近 0] --&gt; B[预热阶段&lt;br/&gt;线性爬升到峰值 lr_max]\n  B --&gt; C[峰值附近&lt;br/&gt;充分探索损失地形]\n  C --&gt; D{衰减策略}\n  D --&gt;|余弦| E[平滑降到接近 0]\n  D --&gt;|线性| F[匀速降到接近 0]\n  D --&gt;|WSD| G[先恒定 再快速退火]\n  E --&gt; H[末段稳定收敛]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>预热为什么必要？训练初期参数还是随机的，<a href=\"adaptive-adam\">二阶矩估计</a> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也不可靠，此时若直接上大学习率，极易触发 <a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">loss spike</a> 甚至发散。预热给优化器一个「热身」期，让动量和二阶矩积累到可靠状态，再逐步放开步长。它对 Transformer 尤其关键——几乎没有不带预热就能稳定训出的大语言模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主流衰减策略对比\">主流衰减策略对比</h2><p>衰减阶段的曲线形状有多种选择，各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>曲线形状</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阶梯衰减 (Step)</td>\n<td>每隔若干 epoch 乘以衰减因子</td>\n<td>简单、CNN 经典</td>\n<td>需手调衰减点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余弦退火 (Cosine)</td>\n<td>半个余弦周期平滑降到 0</td>\n<td>平滑、效果稳、最常用</td>\n<td>需预知总步数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性衰减 (Linear)</td>\n<td>从峰值匀速降到 0</td>\n<td>简单，大模型常用</td>\n<td>末段下降偏快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WSD (Warmup-Stable-Decay)</td>\n<td>预热—长期恒定—末段快速退火</td>\n<td>可中途加 checkpoint 续训</td>\n<td>退火段长度需调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>余弦退火长期是默认之选，它的平滑下降配合末段趋近于零的小步长，往往能稳稳收敛到不错的解。其数学形式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>π</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_t = \\eta_{\\min} + \\tfrac{1}{2}(\\eta_{\\max}-\\eta_{\\min})\\left(1+\\cos\\frac{t-t_{warm}}{T-t_{warm}}\\pi\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>近年在大模型预训练中，WSD（Warmup-Stable-Decay）调度越来越受青睐。它在预热后让学习率长时间保持恒定，只在训练末段才快速退火。最大好处是「可续训」：恒定段的任意 checkpoint 都可以作为新的起点继续训练或退火，不像余弦那样必须一开始就锁死总步数——这对要反复加数据、调规模的大模型工程极为实用。</p>\n<p>把三种曲线的学习率写成步数的函数，形状差异就很直观：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def lr_at(step, peak, total, warmup, kind):&#10;    if step &lt; warmup:                       # 预热：从 0 线性爬升&#10;        return peak * step / warmup&#10;    if kind == &quot;cosine&quot;:                    # 余弦：平滑退到接近 0&#10;        p = (step - warmup) / (total - warmup)&#10;        return peak * 0.5 * (1 + math.cos(math.pi * p))&#10;    if kind == &quot;linear&quot;:                    # 线性：匀速降到 0&#10;        return peak * (1 - (step - warmup) / (total - warmup))&#10;    if kind == &quot;wsd&quot;:                       # WSD：恒定段 + 末段退火&#10;        decay_start = int(0.9 * total)&#10;        if step &lt; decay_start:&#10;            return peak&#10;        return peak * (total - step) / (total - decay_start)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lr_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(step, peak, total, warmup, kind):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warmup:                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 预热：从 0 线性爬升</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warmup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"cosine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 余弦：平滑退到接近 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warmup) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warmup)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math.cos(math.pi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"linear\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 线性：匀速降到 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warmup) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warmup))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"wsd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># WSD：恒定段 + 末段退火</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        decay_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decay_start:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decay_start)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三者的共同点是都要先经过预热段；差别只在峰值之后的衰减曲线。这也解释了为什么调度换一下、最终质量可能差出一大截——它直接改变了训练全程的有效步长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调度与批量-优化器的耦合\">调度与批量、优化器的耦合</h2><p>学习率调度从不孤立。它与<a href=\"../scaling/large-batch-distributed\">批量大小</a>强耦合：批量增大会降低<a href=\"../foundations/gradient-descent-variants\">梯度噪声</a>，需要按比例提高峰值学习率把噪声补回来（线性缩放法则），同时往往要相应延长预热步数，否则大批量初期更容易发散。</p>\n<p>它也与优化器耦合。<a href=\"adaptive-adam\">AdamW</a> 本身已自适应缩放各参数步长，但全局学习率与衰减曲线仍不可或缺；权重衰减系数有时也随学习率一同调度。换优化器（如换成 <a href=\"adaptive-adam\">Muon</a>）通常要重调峰值学习率与预热长度，不能照搬。这种耦合意味着学习率调度必须和批量、优化器作为一个整体来调，这是<a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">训练配方</a>统筹的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"其他常用技巧\">其他常用技巧</h2><p>除主流形状外，还有几个实用技巧。「循环学习率」让学习率在上下界之间周期性振荡，有时能跳出局部解、加速收敛。「学习率范围测试」（指数扫描学习率看 loss 曲线）用来快速定位合理的峰值。「重启」（warm restart）则在余弦衰减到底后突然把学习率拉回高位重新衰减，制造多次「退火—跳出」循环，常配合模型集成使用。</p>\n<p>最后一个工程提醒：调度是按「优化步」还是按「epoch」计步，在分布式与<a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">梯度累积</a>场景下容易搞混。改变批量、累积步数或 GPU 数时，务必确认调度的总步数口径一致，否则衰减曲线会被无声地拉伸或压缩，导致复现失败。</p>\n<p>围绕调度有几个反复出现的反模式，值得单独记下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不预热直接上峰值学习率</td>\n<td>初期 loss spike 甚至 NaN</td>\n<td>补齐几百到几千步的线性预热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换了批量却不改学习率与预热</td>\n<td>训练变慢或发散</td>\n<td>按线性缩放法则同步调整峰值与预热长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余弦调度中途加数据</td>\n<td>总步数变了，退火曲线被打乱</td>\n<td>改用 WSD 或重设总步数后重启退火</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换优化器却照搬旧调度</td>\n<td>收敛异常</td>\n<td>换 Muon 等需重调峰值学习率与预热</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些反模式的共同根因是「把调度当成孤立旋钮」，而它实际上与批量、优化器、计步口径牢牢绑在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>学习率调度把学习率写成步数的函数，遵循「预热爬升 + 逐步衰减」的两段式，是回报率最高的工程旋钮之一。</li>\n<li>预热让动量与二阶矩在初期热身到可靠状态，避免大学习率冲垮随机初始化，对 Transformer 几乎是必需。</li>\n<li>余弦退火平滑稳健、长期默认；WSD 因恒定段可续训、不必预锁总步数，在大模型预训练中日益流行。</li>\n<li>调度与批量大小（线性缩放法则）、优化器选择强耦合，必须作为整体一起调，换批量或换优化器都要重调。</li>\n<li>实用技巧含循环学习率、范围测试、warm restart；分布式与梯度累积下务必统一调度的总步数口径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"学习率调度与预热","id":"学习率调度与预热"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预热加衰减的两段式","id":"核心概念-预热加衰减的两段式"},{"level":2,"text":"主流衰减策略对比","id":"主流衰减策略对比"},{"level":2,"text":"调度与批量、优化器的耦合","id":"调度与批量-优化器的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"其他常用技巧","id":"其他常用技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自适应优化器 Adam","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/optimizers/adaptive-adam"},"next":{"title":"归一化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/stabilization/normalization"}}